  "worked_solution": "The range of $\\operatorname{cos}\u2061x$ is\n\n$$\n-1\\le \\operatorname{cos}\u2061x\\le 1.\n$$\n\nHorizontal shifts and stretches have no effect on the range. Therefore,\n\n$$\n-1\\le \\operatorname{cos}\u2061(3x+\\pi )\\le 1.\n$$\n\nMultiplying the above inequality by $-1$ and then subtracting $4,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-1 & \\le \\operatorname{cos}\u2061(3x+\\pi )\\le 1 \\\\ 1 & \\ge -\\operatorname{cos}\u2061(3x+\\pi )\\ge -1 \\\\ -3 & \\ge -\\operatorname{cos}\u2061(3x+\\pi )-4\\ge -5 \\\\ -5 & \\le f(x)\\le -3.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the minimum value is $-5.$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
